# Nirva Agent System

## Registry (shared/agents.ts)

```typescript
interface Agent {
  name: string;      // UPPERCASE e.g. "DESK"
  role: string;
  tier: "self-hosted" | "hybrid" | "cloud";
  category: string;  // one of 14 categories
}
export const AGENTS: Agent[] = [ ... ]; // 109 items
```

**Total: 109 agents** · **14 categories** · **3 tiers**

